<?php $title='About the café'; require 'includes/header.php'; ?><p class="eyebrow">A SPACE FOR YOUR NEXT LEVEL</p><h1>Gaming, with a plan.</h1><div class="cards"><article><h2>What you reserve</h2><p>A specific gaming seat for a specific date and time interval. For example, PC-01 on 24 October from 14:00 to 16:00.</p></article><article><h2>How pricing works</h2><p>Hourly seat rate × duration. A B$3 seat for two hours costs B$6. The server calculates the final total.</p></article><article><h2>Before you arrive</h2><p>Keep your booking reference. Ask café staff for assistance with changes or cancellations. Online payment is outside this prototype.</p></article></div><section><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><details><summary>Can two customers book the same seat?</summary><p>They can reserve different times. The server rejects overlapping active reservations.</p></details><details><summary>Can I book a group?</summary><p>This version reserves one seat per booking. Make a separate booking for each seat.</p></details><details><summary>Where is the café?</summary><p>This is a fictional coursework café. Actual address, contact details and commercial opening hours have not been supplied.</p></details></section><?php require 'includes/footer.php'; ?>